### ============================================
### NestJS Solana API Tests (Authentication Config)
### ============================================

### Variables for Authentication
# 1. First, call the auth login endpoints below to receive your token.
# 2. Copy the token and paste it here:
@authToken = YOUR_TOKEN_HERE

### 1a. Authenticate - FREE Tier (100 req/min limit)
POST http://127.0.0.1:3000/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "free_user",
  "tier": "free"
}

### 1b. Authenticate - PRO Tier (1000 req/min limit)
POST http://127.0.0.1:3000/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "pro_user",
  "tier": "pro"
}

### ============================================
### NestJS Solana API Endpoints
### ============================================

### 2. General Health Check (Public)
GET http://127.0.0.1:3000/

### 3. Solana Network Health Status (Public)
GET http://127.0.0.1:3000/wallet/health

### 4. Check Wallet Balance (Private)
GET http://127.0.0.1:3000/wallet/{{$dotenv TEST_WALLET_ADDRESS}}/balance
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 5. Fetch Recent Wallet Transactions (Private)
GET http://127.0.0.1:3000/wallet/{{$dotenv TEST_WALLET_ADDRESS}}/transactions?limit=5
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 6. Specific Transaction Detail (Private)
GET http://127.0.0.1:3000/transactions/5oG4k6aJ4DYZJq1x5M5eX7d6Y5F2e9b8Z3c1A4f5E6d7
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 7. Advanced Transactions List with Filters and Pagination (Private)
GET http://127.0.0.1:3000/transactions?wallet={{$dotenv TEST_WALLET_ADDRESS}}&limit=5&offset=0&sortBy=timestamp&sortOrder=desc
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 7a. Filter by type (transfer)
GET http://127.0.0.1:3000/transactions?wallet={{$dotenv TEST_WALLET_ADDRESS}}&limit=5&type=transfer
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 7b. Filter by type (instruction)
GET http://127.0.0.1:3000/transactions?wallet={{$dotenv TEST_WALLET_ADDRESS}}&limit=5&type=instruction
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 7c. Sort by amount (ascending)
GET http://127.0.0.1:3000/transactions?wallet={{$dotenv TEST_WALLET_ADDRESS}}&limit=5&sortBy=amount&sortOrder=asc
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### ============================================
### US-E4 — Token Metadata & Holders (Private)
### ============================================

### 8. SPL Token Information & Metadata (From .env TEST_TOKEN_MINT)
GET http://127.0.0.1:3000/tokens/{{$dotenv TEST_TOKEN_MINT}}
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 9. Top Holders of SPL Token
GET http://127.0.0.1:3000/tokens/{{$dotenv TEST_TOKEN_MINT}}/holders
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 10. Token Transfer History
GET http://127.0.0.1:3000/tokens/{{$dotenv TEST_TOKEN_MINT}}/transfers?limit=10
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 11. Invalid mint address (should return 400 cleanly)
GET http://127.0.0.1:3000/tokens/not-a-valid-mint
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### ============================================
### US-E5 — Wallet Analytics (Private)
### ============================================

### 12. Full Wallet Analytics (balance, portfolio, 30-day volume, gains/losses, wallet age)
GET http://127.0.0.1:3000/wallet/{{$dotenv TEST_WALLET_ADDRESS}}/analytics
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
